<title>UK: Tesco shares up after broker upgrade.</title>
<headline>Tesco shares up after broker upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in supermarket group Tesco Plc bucked a generally lower market on Wednesday as NatWest Securities upgraded the stock to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, market sources said.</p>
<p>Tesco stock rose 6p to 327-1/2p.</p>
<p>NatWest analysts were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
